# Nested ignore for the LegionJolt physics region module. Scoped to THIS tree only.
#
# The repo-root .gitignore blanket-ignores *.csproj (root .gitignore line 4) because most
# OpenSim projects are GENERATED by prebuild.xml. This module is the opposite: hand-maintained
# (runprebuild is forbidden against this tree) and BRAND NEW, so its csproj carries the ONLY
# copy of the project definition - the explicit <Compile> list, the ProjectReferences to
# SharedBase / the region framework / the Legion.Physics backend, and the JoltPhysicsSharp +
# joltc native copy wiring. Under the root rule a clean checkout could not build the module.
# Re-include it. (Mirrors OpenSim/Addons/LegionPhysics/.gitignore; the same csproj-gitignored trap.)
!*.csproj

# The repo root also ignores .gitignore itself; re-include THIS nested file so the exception
# travels with a clean clone. bin/ and obj/ stay ignored via the root patterns - not negated here.
!.gitignore
